<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Corporate Express started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Corporate Express started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Corporate Express Inc as a trading buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Corporate Express gained 13/16 to 17.</p>
